desc(
	mode: "source"
	language: "general"
	title: "Detect PseudoRandomBytes"
	title_zh: "Detect PseudoRandomBytes"
	type: vuln
	level: middle
	rule_id: "source-insecure-api-detect-pseudoRandomBytes"
	risk: "weak-randomness"
	desc: <<<DESC
### 规则说明
Detected usage of crypto.pseudoRandomBytes, which does not produce secure random numbers.

### 风险类型
弱随机数（weak-randomness）

### 影响
使用不安全的伪随机数生成器，可能导致令牌、密钥或安全决策可预测。

### 检测方式
Source 模式正则匹配，检测代码或配置中符合该风险模式的位置。

### 补充说明
Note: source-mode regex approximation of a safe-literal pattern.

### 参考
- CWE: CWE-338: Use of Cryptographically Weak Pseudo-Random Number Generator (PRNG)
DESC
	solution: <<<SOLUTION
### 修复建议
使用密码学安全的随机数生成器。
SOLUTION
	alert_min: 1
	"file://pos.js": <<<POS
crypto.pseudoRandomBytes
POS
	"safefile://pos.js": <<<NEG
crypto.randomBytes
NEG
)

${*.js}.pattern_regex(/(?:crypto\.pseudoRandomBytes)/) as $p0
${*.ts}.pattern_regex(/(?:crypto\.pseudoRandomBytes)/) as $p1
$p0 + $p1 as $hit
alert $hit for {
	level: "middle",
	title: "Detect PseudoRandomBytes",
	title_zh: "Detect PseudoRandomBytes",
	message: "Detect PseudoRandomBytes detected.",
}
